      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "aH",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "downstream dag_a → dag_b (1), dag_d (1), dag_c (2).   Link nodes (asset, trigger, sensor) never count as a hop;\nthey are reported as \"via\". A DAG reachable by two paths is listed once, at its shortest hop count.\nOnly explicit Airflow dependencies are visible — table-level coupling without an asset is not.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1142413133,
      "strokeColor": "#333",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "downstream dag_a → dag_b (1), dag_d (1), dag_c (2).   Link nodes (asset, trigger, sensor) never count as a hop;\nthey are reported as \"via\". A DAG reachable by two paths is listed once, at its shortest hop count.\nOnly explicit Airflow dependencies are visible — table-level coupling without an asset is not.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1792678411272,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2121429409,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
